OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMostly dry and bright with good
OL,6,Fsunny spells, but somewhat cloudier in
OL,7,Fthe afternoon with the chance of the
OL,8,Fodd shower. Fresh winds at first will
OL,9,Fsoon become light.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FMostly dry through the
OL,12,Fevening with some bright spells at
OL,13,Ffirst. Outbreaks of occasionally heavy
OL,14,Frain in the west overnight, staying
OL,15,Fmostly dry in the east. Freshening
OL,16,Fsoutherly winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
